<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">1 Peter</book>
  <para style="h">1 Peter</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Peter</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Peter</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Peter</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Peter, Jesu Khrist sawltah in, Pontius gam, Galatia gam, Kappadosia gam, Asia gam leh Bithinia gamte a kithezah mivaithaamte kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thumang ding leh Jesu Khrist sisan the tang dinga Hagau suhsiengna zieh a Pa Pasian theilawhna dungzuia telte kungah, hepina leh lungmuonna na kung uah suhpungin umta hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I Mangpa Jesu Khrist Pa leh Pasian phat in umta hen, Aman akhotuona kiningchingtah dungzui in, shina a kipat a Jesu Khrist thawkiana ziehin pienthana kinepna hing, eite ahing peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Gouluo ding setheilou, buatheilou leh tuoitheilou van a nou a dinga kikhet tang dingin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hun nukhia lam chienga kilang dinga mansa a um hundamna tang dinga ginna zieh a Pasian silbawltheina a kep na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuin hun tomnou khat sung, ze etna tuomtuom thuohin lungkham tadi nan u’lachin, tam hundamna ah nasatahin na kipah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na ginna uh etchienna khu, sana mei a halsieng nua nangawn a, mangthai zel sanga manpha zaw, Jesu Khrist hing kilah ni chienga, pahtawina leh thupina a mu a aum theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama mu ngai lounapi in na it ua, tuin Ama mu sih nan u’lachin zong na gingta ua, kipahna gensenglou leh thupina a dimin na kipah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na ginna uh buchinna, na hagau uh hundam na ngei khu muin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tam hundam na thu khu, na kung ua hing tung ding hepina thu na genlawh guolneiten ana kan kawikawi ua, phatuom ngai tah in ana suidoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amaute sunga um Khrist Hagau in, Khrist thuohna ding thu leh anua a hing zui ding thupina ana matheisah lai un, amauten bang hun leh bangchibanga hing tung ding ahiei chi thei tum in ana sui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Van akipat a hingkisawlkhie Hagau Siengthou pansan a na kung ua khantanhoi agen lai un, ama ua dinga nasem hilou in eite dinga sem ahi uh chi, amaute kungah theisahin aumta hi. Vansawlsiengte nangawnin tam silte mu ding alunggul mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaziehin na lungsim kawnguh gah unlen, pilvangun, Jesu Khrist hing kilah chienga noute ahing puohpieh ding hepina ah na kinepna uh nga unlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />ta thumangte bangin, na theilou lai ua na nidang lai tahsa utnate uh banga umlou in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh noute hing hanpa asienthou bangin, noute zong na gamtatdan zousie uah siengthou un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aziehpen “Noute siengthou un, Kei ka siengthou hi,” chi’n akigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh deisahtuom neilou a mi chin anasep dung zuia thukhenpa khu, Pa chia han na hi u’leh, tam leitunga khuolzin banga na taam hun sungun zaudan siem in um un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Napu napate ua kipat a, tawndan a nana nei uh na hindan uh kisesa apat, akisethei sana leh dangka a tatdoh na hi sih ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanleh belamnou gensiet bei leh nieh banglou sisan banga, amanpha mama Khrist sisan a tat na hi zaw uh, chi na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama pen leitung kisiem masang peh a guotlawhin aum ngei a, hinanleh tam hun nukhiate ah noute zieh a sulat in a umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama ziehin mishi lah a kipata, Ama kaithoupa leh thupina pepa Pasian na gingta uhi; tuachi’n na ginna u’leh na kinepnate uh Pasian a ahi theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Unaute it tahtah ding a thutah zui a na hagau uh na suhsiengthou tahzieh un, phatuom ngaitahin khat le khat lungtang siengthouin ki it tuo chiet un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chi sethei lah ah hilou in, chi setheilou Pasian thu kumtawn a hing zing leh umden lah a piengtha na hi zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aziehpen, “Mihing zousie loupa bang ahia, athupina zousie u’zong gamlah, loupa pah bang ahi, loupate avuoi a, apahte zong apul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa thu pen kumtawn in aumden hi.” Tami na kung ua khantanhoi pansan a thu kigen khu ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaziehin gitlouna zousie, kisolbawlna zousie, lepchienate, kithangsietnate leh kigensietna zousiete, koimang unlen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Naungeh suohthate bangin, na hundam na ua na khantou theina dingun, hagau nawitui sieng bangma toh hallou lunggul un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mangpa khu mi hepisiem ahi chi na chiem zouthamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama mite deilou hinanleh Pasian tel leh manpha suong hing kung lam nouten na hing zuonta ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Noute zong suong hingte banga, Pasian pomtah hagau lam kithoinate lan ding a siempu siengthou leh hagau inn a lamtou na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaziehin Laisiengthou ah zong, “En un, Zion ah aningah suong poimawpen, tel leh manpha tah ka phum hi, Ama gingta pouma amuolphou, ngai sih ding hi,” chiin akigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaziehin nou agingtate dingin Ama amanpha hi, hinanleh agingtaloute a dingin, “Inn lammiten adeilou uh suong khu, aninga suong poimawpen ahing hita hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh, “Mite kipalpuasah suong leh, amauh kipuana suongpi ahi.” Amaun thu kigente amanlou ziehun, thu ah akipalpua ua, tuabang dinga guot zong ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh avahna lamdang tah a lut dinga miel a kipat a noute hing handohpa phatnate na phuonzah theina dingun, noute pen nam tel leng siempu, nam siengthou, Pasian deituom, Ama mite na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ni danglai in nam a sim na hi sih ua, tuin pen Pasian mite na hita uhi. Ni danglai in khotuona tangloute na hi ua, hinanleh tuin pen khotuona na tangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ittahte aw, mikhuol leh khuolzin bang na hi ziehun hagau doudal tahsa utnate tawpsan dingin ka hing ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jentelte lah a na gamtat dan uh kilawmtah hi heh, tuachia, silgilou bawlte banga ahing gensiet chieng ua, na nasep hoi uh amute u’zieh a ve a aum ni chieng ua, Pasian apahtawi theina ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa ziehin mihing thuneina tawi dansiemte nuoi ah kitulut un, thuneina sangpen nei ahi ziehin leengpa nuoi ah kitulut un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahisihleh silgilou bawlte gawt ding leh sil hoi bawlte phat dinga, leengpa’n asawl uhpipate nuoi ah zong kitulut un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aziehpen na silhoi bawl ua, mi mote na sipsah thei ding u’khu Pasian deilam ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Noplente bangin gamta un, hinanleh na noplenna u’khu gitlouna khukhumna dingin zang sih unlen, Pasian suohte bangin gamta zaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi zousie zatat un. Na unaute uh it un. Pasian ging un. Lengpa zatat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Suohte aw, giin dan siem in na pute uh kungah kitulut un, ahoite leh anunnemte kung guoh ah hilou in, ahuhamte thu zong mangun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian lam a sie leh pha theina zieh a mi’n gimna leh dihloutaha athuoh leh tua pen pahtat taah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na dihlouna zieh ua vuoh na thuoh un, kukal tahin thuohnan u’lachin, pahtatna bang ahiei na law uh? Hinanleh silhoi na bawlna ziehun thuoh law unlen, kukaltahin thuoh u’lachin, tam pen Pasian pahtat lam ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tambang bawl dinga hat na hi uhi, aziehpen Khrist in zong aketot a na zui dinguh, etton ding hing nuasiein eite taangin ana thuohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama’n khelna mawngmawng abawl sih a, akam ah zong zebawlna thu akimu ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama a enghou laiun, enghou in athuh sih a, genthei athuoh laiin zong avau sih hi, hinanleh ditattaha thukhenpa kungah akikemsah zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Eite khelna lam a shi a, dihtatna lama i hintheina dingin Aman ama sapum mama in ikhelnate sing dawn ah apuo a, Ama kivuohna huoltaite ah suhdam in na umta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aziehpen noute belam bangin nana pielmangta ua, hinanleh tuin vang belampu leh na hinna hagau uh entuppa kungah na hing kinuale kia ta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tambangin nou zite aw, na pasalte u’kung chiet ah kitulut un, tuachi’n amaute lah a koi ahiei in Pasian thu gingta sihnan leh thu lou a, zite gamtatdan a zawin aum thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zaudan siem kawma na gamtatdan siengthou uh a et chiengun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na kilawmnate u’khu, pulam kizepna samphehte leh sana khi awte, ahisihleh puonsil a kizepnate hilouin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mihing lungtanga kiphuol lungsim kingaingiemna leh nunnemna puonsil setheilou hi heh, tuakhu Pasian mitmu in amanpha mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aziehpen tambangmain nidanglai a numei siengthou, Pasian gingtate zong amauh pasalte thunuoi a lut in ana kizem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sarah in Abraham khu mangpa chia han a athu aman bangin; noute zong zauna mawngmawng giinglou a sil hoi na bawl u’leh Sarah tanute na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuamabangin nou pasalte aw, na zite uh bel kikeh baizaw banga ngaituo in, hinna hepina tangkhawm ding na hina uh theisiemin pahtawidan siem in um khawm un, tua hileh na thungetna uh dalin a um sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Atawppen in lungsim mun khat puoin, khat leh khat kilainat tuo chiet unlen, sanggam bangin ki it unlen, kingiemkhieh unlen, lungnem un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gitlouna, gitlounain thuh sih unlen, gensietna zong gensietnain thuh sih un, hinanleh guolzawlna tang dinga hatna hi uh chi theiin, guolzawl zaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen, “Hinna it a, ni hoite mu ut in, gitlouna apat alei veng hoi henlen, akam zong solna thu genlou dingin veng heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Gitlouna kiheisan henlen, sil hoi bawl hen, kilemna sui henlen del zel hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa mit khu midihtatte tungah atu a, athungetna lam uah abil adaw hi. Hinanleh sil gilou bawlte tungah pen,” Mangpa mai agum ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sil hoi bawl na ut u’leh, noute hing suse ding koi ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh dihtatna zieh a na thuoh u’leh na hampha uhi; ahing giihnate ziehun zau sih unlen, tualeh lungkham sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh na lungtang uah, Mangpa Pasian khu susiengthou unlen, tualeh nouma aum kinepna azieh hing dong poumate, lungnemtah leh zaudan siemtah a dawng dingin bangchihlai pouin mansa in um un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khrist a na gamtat hoi dan uh, dihloutaha hing genseten, silgilou bawl banga ahing gensietna ua, a kizumsuo theina dingun, sie leh pha theina hoitah nei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pasian deilam ahipou leh, gitlouna bawl zieha thuoh sangin, sil hoi bawl zieh athuoh ahoi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian kunga eite ahing pui theina dingin Khrist in zong khelnate ziehin khatvei athuohta a, midih in midihloute dingin tahsa a tha in a um a, hinanleh Hagau a hinsah in a um hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua Hagau ziehin Ama ava pei a, suongkul a um hagaute kungah khantanhoi ava gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuate khu nidanglai a, Noah damlaia kuong abawl sung teng, Pasian in thuohzoutah a angah lai in athumang sih ua, tua kuongah mi tawmnoukhat a unpi un mi giet bep tui a kipat hundamin a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua lim etsahnain baptisma in tuin, tahsa niehna silsiengna hilouin, Pasian lam a sie leh pha theina hoi suhlungkimna hi zawin, Jesu Khrist thawkianain ahing hundam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jesu Khrist van ah apeita a, Pasian ziet lam ah a um a, vansawlsiengte leh thuneinate tualeh silbawltheinate Ama thunuoi a koi ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaziehin Khrist in eite a dinga tahsa a hing thuohta ahi ziehin, noute zong tuabang lungsim toh ki thuom un, aziehpen koipou tahsa a thuohsa in khelna atawpsanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A hun um nalai teng tahsa a mihing utna lam banga hing nawnlou a, Pasian deilam a ahinzoh na dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aziehpen huasannate, utnate, zukhamhatnate, zumun nopnate, zukhamnate leh akidahhuoi milim biehnate sunga buol a, Jentelte deilam bawlna i hun peisa hinkhuote uh ahunta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuabanga na gamta thanghuoiten, tu a amaute bawl banga na bawl nawnlou uh lamdang asa ua, noute ahing gense zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amaun mihing leh mishite tunga vaihawm dinga mansa a umpa mai ah atanchin uh agen ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aziehpen tahsa a um mihingte banga thukhenpieh a aum ua, hagau a Pasian banga ahin theina ding ua, akung ua khantanhoi gena um ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh sil zousie tawpna ding anaita hi, tuaziehin lungsim dihtah puo unlen, lungluttah a thungen kawmin pilvang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bangteng tungah kingainatahin khat leh khat ki ittuo chiet un, aziehpen ki itna in khelna tampi akhukhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Phunchieh lou in khat leh khat kizintun tuo un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Michin in Pasian hepina chi tuom tuom kemmi hoitah bangin, silpieh na mu bangbang un nna kiseppieh tuo chiet un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi koipou in thu agen leh Pasian kam a thupawt bangin gen heh. Mi koipou in nna asep leh Pasian in hatna apieh bang zel in sem heh, Jesu Khrist zieh a silbangkim a Pasian pahtawi a aum theina ding in, Thupina leh vaihawmna, kumtawn kumtawn a Ama a ahi. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />It tahte aw, Noute ze et dinga, na tung ua ze etna hing tung khu, sil lamdang bang ahiei hing tung bangin ngaituo sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khrist thuohnate thuohpi na hi ziehun, kipah un, tuachia athupina ahing kilat hun chiengin noute zong nahpitah a nuomin na kipah thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khrist min zieh a housieta na um u’leh mi hampha na hi uhi, aziehpen thupina Hagau leh Pasian Hagau na tung uah a um hi. Amauh lam thu ah Ama gensiet in a um a, hinanleh nou lam ah pen Ama pahtawi in a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh noute koima’n, tuolthat bangin ahiei, guta bangin ahiei, silgilou bawl bangin ahiei, ahisihleh midangte sil bawlna a kikumthawna zieh bangin ahiei in thuoh sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahivang in mi koipou Khristian ahi zieh a athuoh leh zum sih heh, tami ziehin Pasian pahtawi zaw heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian innkuonte lah ah vaihawmna pat hun ahing tungta hi, eite tunga pat masah ahi leh Pasian khantanhoi gingta loute tawpna khu bang ahita bep de aw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh, “Midihtat bawn hundam ahi hamham leh, Pasian gingta loute leh mikhielte, hei ah akilangta diei”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaziehin koipou Pasian phatsah dungzuia thuohten sil hoi bawl in ahagau uh siempa ginumtah kung ah kemsah uhen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Na lah ua upate khu, Kei na upa hipi u’leh, Khrist thuohnate theipipa leh ahing kilang ding thupina tang sam ding khat in, ka hing hanthawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na lah ua Pasian belam pawl umte ching hoi un, aloutheilou ahizieh hilou in, na ut zieh uh hizaw in, punna dihlou dei zieh zong hilou in, sep ding kilawpna in hizaw heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pasian in noute ahing kepsahte tunga kiliensah lou in, belamhonte etton dingin umzaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh belampu lienpen ahing kilah chiengin, atul theilou thupina manglukhu na sang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuamabangin nou khanglaite upate nuoi ah kitulut un. Ahi, na bawn un khat leh khat nuoi ah, kitulut tuo chiet unlen, kingaingiemna sil un, aziehpen: “Pasian in akiliensahte a dou a, akingaingiemte pen hepina apie hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaziehin ahuntah a noute ahing pahtawi theina dingin Pasian khut hattah nuoi ah kingaingiem un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aman ahing ngaisah ziehin, na lunggimna zousie uh Ama tungah nga un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pilvang unlen, kiveng zingin um un, aziehpen na melmapa uh Diabol humpibahnei hawh bangin anawmval thei ding suiin aviel vah kawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na unaute uh leitung a umte tungah tuabang thuohnate atung sam hi, chi theiin, ginna a kiptah a umin dawimangpa dou un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh Khrist Jesu a kumtawn thupina tang dinga eite hing hanpa leh hepina Pasian in, hun tomkhat na thuoh nua chiengun, ahing hoibukimsahin, hing phut det in, hing hatsahin, tualeh ahing umdetsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama kungah kumtawn in thupina leh vaihawmna umta hen. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />I unaupa uh ginumtah a ka thei Silvanus hunain, noute hanthawnna leh tami Pasian hepina dihtah i dinna uh ahi chi theisah kawmin na kung uah tomnoukhat in ka hing giel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Noute toh tel khawm Babilona um hattuomten mangpha ahing hah uhi, tuamabangin ka tapa Mak in zong ahing hah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Itna a kitawp in khat leh khat kinousiet un, Khrist Jesu a um noute kungah, lungmuonna um hen. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
